WEBVTT

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:31.496
AG: Of the thousands of Californians
who lost their homes,

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:33.756
several were Jessica's colleagues.

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:35.862
JCK: That didn't stop them
from volunteering

00:20:35.886 --> 00:20:39.004
or being a part
of everything either, so ...

00:20:39.028 --> 00:20:41.776
I could not have done it
without their support.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.003
AG: Each year, Hilton's CEO
presents the Light and Warmth Award

00:20:45.027 --> 00:20:48.736
to a dozen of their 425,000 team members.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.266
It's the highest honor in the company,

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.346
given to people
who embody Hilton's vision,

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:55.026
mission and values.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:57.204
JCK: I knew about
the Light and Warmth Award,

00:20:57.228 --> 00:21:00.965
but I never thought
that I would even be thought of.